=== [Benchmark 3] Global Bidirectional Infilling (Seeing the Future Clue!) ===
[audit #16] NOTE: cloze sentences are training sentences -> this tests memorized infilling (see #16)
Clue in Suffix: '周末下午我特地去了一趟 [___] ，在书架上挑了两本最喜欢的科幻小说安静地阅读。' (Ground Truth: [图书馆])
  -> AR-MiniMind greedy (Blind to Suffix) guessed: [生鲜超]
  -> AR-MiniMind LL-rank (sees suffix via scoring): [图书馆]  LL=图书馆:-2.3, 牙科诊所:-24.5, 生鲜超市:-24.3
  -> Diffusion-MiniMind (Full Sight) guessed: [图书馆]
Clue in Suffix: '周末下午我特地去了一趟 [___] ，请专业医生帮我检查牙齿并清理了牙结石。' (Ground Truth: [牙科诊所])
  -> AR-MiniMind greedy (Blind to Suffix) guessed: [生鲜超市]
  -> AR-MiniMind LL-rank (sees suffix via scoring): [牙科诊所]  LL=图书馆:-34.9, 牙科诊所:-2.3, 生鲜超市:-14.2
  -> Diffusion-MiniMind (Full Sight) guessed: [牙科诊所]
Clue in Suffix: '周末下午我特地去了一趟 [___] ，买了新鲜的苹果、牛奶和面包准备做早餐。' (Ground Truth: [生鲜超市])
  -> AR-MiniMind greedy (Blind to Suffix) guessed: [生鲜超市]
  -> AR-MiniMind LL-rank (sees suffix via scoring): [生鲜超市]  LL=图书馆:-24.2, 牙科诊所:-14.6, 生鲜超市:-2.3
  -> Diffusion-MiniMind (Full Sight) guessed: [生鲜超市]

[Infilling Token Accuracy]: AR-MiniMind greedy = 4/11 (36.4%) vs Diffusion-MiniMind = 11/11 (100.0%)
[Infilling Sentence Accuracy]: AR LL-rank (3-way) = 3/3 | AR greedy exact = 1/3 | Diffusion exact fill = 3/3
[audit #16] NOTE: AR LL-rank is a 3-way choice (chance 1/3); diffusion is open-vocabulary but is told the answer length via the mask count.
